diagram 複数Cellの更新前の値を参照
time_end 3
layout auto

stream input events 1:100, 2:100, 3:100
cell first = 10 changes 1:20
cell second = 5 changes 1:7
cell third = 2 changes 2:3
snapshot total cells 3 = sub
sink out

input -> total.event
first -> total.c1
second -> total.c2
third -> total.c3
total -> out
